          "id": "code-ml-24-1-ch24_1_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: LOF Breunig et al. (2000) vs Global KDE pada Klaster Multi-Densitas",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "24_1_lof_breunig_vs_kde_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import KernelDensity, LocalOutlierFactor\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2411)\n\n# Bangkitkan dataset berkepadatan ganda (multi-density):\n# Klaster C1: sangat padat (sigma = 0.22, N = 160) di sekitar [0, 0]\n# Klaster C2: sangat renggang (sigma = 1.65, N = 160) di sekitar [8.5, 0]\n# Local outliers (10 titik): berjarak hanya ~1.15 dari pusat C1 (sangat anomali terhadap C1,\n#   tetapi kepadatan globalnya MASIH lebih tinggi/dekat daripada anggota tepi klaster renggang C2!)\n# Global outliers (6 titik): jauh dari kedua klaster\nc_dense = rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 0.22, size=(160, 2))\nc_sparse = rng.normal([8.5, 0.0], 1.65, size=(160, 2))\n\nangles = np.linspace(0.0, 2.0 * np.pi, 10, endpoint=False)\nlocal_outliers = np.column_stack([1.15 * np.cos(angles), 1.15 * np.sin(angles)])\nglobal_outliers = np.array([\n    [-4.5, 4.0], [-4.2, -3.8], [4.2, 5.2], [4.0, -5.0], [14.5, 4.8], [14.0, -4.6]\n])\n\nX = np.vstack([c_dense, c_sparse, local_outliers, global_outliers])\ny_true = np.array([0] * 320 + [1] * 16)\nis_local = np.zeros(len(X), dtype=bool)\nis_local[320:330] = True\n\ndef lof_from_scratch(X_in: np.ndarray, k: int = 20) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Implementasi persis Breunig, Kriegel, Ng & Sander (SIGMOD 2000):\n      1) k-distance(o) = jarak ke tetangga terdekat ke-k (tidak termasuk diri sendiri)\n      2) reach-dist_k(p, o) = max(k-distance(o), d(p, o))\n      3) lrd_k(p) = 1 / mean_{o in N_k(p)} reach-dist_k(p, o)\n      4) LOF_k(p) = mean_{o in N_k(p)} (lrd_k(o) / lrd_k(p))\n    \"\"\"\n    n = X_in.shape[0]\n    D = np.sqrt(np.sum((X_in[:, None, :] - X_in[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2))\n    np.fill_diagonal(D, np.inf)\n\n    # Indeks k tetangga terdekat per titik (asumsi jarak unik / kontinyu)\n    order = np.argsort(D, axis=1)\n    knn_idx = order[:, :k]\n    k_dist = D[np.arange(n), knn_idx[:, -1]]\n\n    # Local Reachability Density (LRD)\n    lrd = np.zeros(n, dtype=float)\n    for p in range(n):\n        nbs = knn_idx[p]\n        reach_dists = np.maximum(k_dist[nbs], D[p, nbs])\n        lrd[p] = 1.0 / max(float(np.mean(reach_dists)), 1e-10)\n\n    # Local Outlier Factor (LOF)\n    lof = np.zeros(n, dtype=float)\n    for p in range(n):\n        nbs = knn_idx[p]\n        lof[p] = float(np.mean(lrd[nbs]) / lrd[p])\n\n    return lof, lrd, k_dist\n\nlof_scratch, lrd_scratch, kdist_scratch = lof_from_scratch(X, k=20)\n\n# Verifikasi eksak terhadap sklearn.neighbors.LocalOutlierFactor\nlof_sk = LocalOutlierFactor(n_neighbors=20, metric=\"euclidean\", novelty=False)\nlof_sk.fit_predict(X)\nsk_lof_scores = -lof_sk.negative_outlier_factor_\nmax_err = float(np.max(np.abs(lof_scratch - sk_lof_scores)))\n\n# Bandingkan dengan Global KDE (Gaussian bandwidth=0.75) & jarak k-NN absolut\nkde = KernelDensity(kernel=\"gaussian\", bandwidth=0.75).fit(X)\nneg_log_kde = -kde.score_samples(X)  # Semakin besar -> semakin dianggap outlier\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Verifikasi LOF Scratch (Breunig 2000) vs Scikit-Learn LOF (k=20) ===\")\nprint(f\"Max |LOF_scratch - (-negative_outlier_factor_)| = {max_err:.2e}\")\nprint(f\"Mean LOF Inlier Klaster Padat  (C1)             = {np.mean(lof_scratch[:160]):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Mean LOF Inlier Klaster Renggang (C2)           = {np.mean(lof_scratch[160:320]):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Mean LOF Local Outliers (sekitar C1)            = {np.mean(lof_scratch[is_local]):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Mean LOF Global Outliers                        = {np.mean(lof_scratch[330:]):.4f}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Global KDE vs k-Dist Absolut vs Local Outlier Factor pada Klaster Multi-Densitas ===\")\nprint(\"Detektor               | ROC-AUC (All) | PR-AUC (All) | Top-16 Recall Local | Top-16 Recall All\")\nprint(\"-\" * 96)\nfor name, score in [\n    (\"Global KDE (h=0.75)\", neg_log_kde),\n    (\"Absolut k-NN Dist\", kdist_scratch),\n    (\"LOF Scratch (k=20)\", lof_scratch),\n]:\n    roc = float(roc_auc_score(y_true, score))\n    pr = float(average_precision_score(y_true, score))\n    top16 = np.argsort(score)[-16:]\n    rec_local = 100.0 * float(np.sum(is_local[top16]) / np.sum(is_local))\n    rec_all = 100.0 * float(np.sum(y_true[top16]) / np.sum(y_true))\n    print(f\"{name:22s} | {roc:13.4f} | {pr:12.4f} | {rec_local:18.1f}% | {rec_all:16.1f}%\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi LOF Scratch (Breunig 2000) vs Scikit-Learn LOF (k=20) ===\nMax |LOF_scratch - (-negative_outlier_factor_)| = 9.18e-09\nMean LOF Inlier Klaster Padat  (C1)             = 1.1369\nMean LOF Inlier Klaster Renggang (C2)           = 1.1615\nMean LOF Local Outliers (sekitar C1)            = 3.3087\nMean LOF Global Outliers                        = 8.5868\n\n=== 2. Global KDE vs k-Dist Absolut vs Local Outlier Factor pada Klaster Multi-Densitas ===\nDetektor               | ROC-AUC (All) | PR-AUC (All) | Top-16 Recall Local | Top-16 Recall All\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGlobal KDE (h=0.75)    |        0.6873 |       0.4078 |                0.0% |             37.5%\nAbsolut k-NN Dist      |        0.7645 |       0.4287 |                0.0% |             37.5%\nLOF Scratch (k=20)     |        1.0000 |       1.0000 |              100.0% |            100.0%",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi LOF Scratch (Breunig 2000) vs Scikit-Learn LOF (k=20) ===\nMax |LOF_scratch - (-negative_outlier_factor_)| = 9.18e-09\nMean LOF Inlier Klaster Padat  (C1)             = 1.1369\nMean LOF Inlier Klaster Renggang (C2)           = 1.1615\nMean LOF Local Outliers (sekitar C1)            = 3.3087\nMean LOF Global Outliers                        = 8.5868\n\n=== 2. Global KDE vs k-Dist Absolut vs Local Outlier Factor pada Klaster Multi-Densitas ===\nDetektor               | ROC-AUC (All) | PR-AUC (All) | Top-16 Recall Local | Top-16 Recall All\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGlobal KDE (h=0.75)    |        0.6873 |       0.4078 |                0.0% |             37.5%\nAbsolut k-NN Dist      |        0.7645 |       0.4287 |                0.0% |             37.5%\nLOF Scratch (k=20)     |        1.0000 |       1.0000 |              100.0% |            100.0%",
