          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import LocalOutlierFactor\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import RobustScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2413)\n\n# Bangkitkan 2 fitur sensor berskala sangat timpang:\n# Fitur 0: tekanan pipa (100 .. 120 bar, normal ~ N(110, 1.5))\n# Fitur 1: getaran mikro (0.002 .. 0.008 mm, normal ~ N(0.005, 0.0005))\nX_clean_tr = np.column_stack([\n    rng.normal(110.0, 1.5, size=240),\n    rng.normal(0.0050, 0.0005, size=240),\n])\n\n# 18 sampel anomali getaran halus (tekanan normal 110 bar, tetapi getaran melonjak 4x ke 0.011 mm!)\nX_anom_batch = np.column_stack([\n    rng.normal(110.0, 1.0, size=18),\n    rng.normal(0.0110, 0.0004, size=18),\n])\n\n# Data latih tercemar (240 normal + 18 anomali getaran yang sudah menyusup ke log historis!)\nX_poisoned_tr = np.vstack([X_clean_tr, X_anom_batch])\n\n# Batch uji streaming baru: 120 normal + 20 anomali getaran serupa\nX_test = np.vstack([\n    np.column_stack([rng.normal(110.0, 1.5, size=120), rng.normal(0.0050, 0.0005, size=120)]),\n    np.column_stack([rng.normal(110.0, 1.0, size=20), rng.normal(0.0110, 0.0004, size=20)]),\n])\ny_test = np.array([0] * 120 + [1] * 20)\n\n# 1) Verifikasi Batas API novelty=False vs novelty=True\nlof_trans = LocalOutlierFactor(n_neighbors=15, novelty=False).fit(X_clean_tr)\ntry:\n    lof_trans.predict(X_test)\n    api_msg = \"Tidak error (tak terduga)\"\nexcept AttributeError as exc:\n    api_msg = f\"AttributeError tertangkap: {str(exc)[:68]}\"\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Kontrak API LocalOutlierFactor: novelty=False (Transduktif) vs novelty=True (Induktif) ===\")\nprint(f\"Panggil .predict() saat novelty=False -> {api_msg}\")\n\n# 2) Audit 3 Konfigurasi Produksi pada Streaming Inference (X_test)\n# A) Anti-Pattern 1: novelty=True TANPA RobustScaler (fitur getaran 0.005 tenggelam oleh tekanan 110!)\nlof_unscaled = LocalOutlierFactor(n_neighbors=15, novelty=True, contamination=0.02).fit(X_clean_tr)\n\n# B) Anti-Pattern 2: RobustScaler + novelty=True dilatih pada data tercemar (data poisoning!)\npipe_poisoned = make_pipeline(\n    RobustScaler(),\n    LocalOutlierFactor(n_neighbors=15, novelty=True, contamination=0.02),\n).fit(X_poisoned_tr)\n\n# C) Production-Safe: RobustScaler + novelty=True dilatih pada baseline bersih (X_clean_tr)\npipe_clean = make_pipeline(\n    RobustScaler(),\n    LocalOutlierFactor(n_neighbors=15, novelty=True, contamination=0.02),\n).fit(X_clean_tr)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Online Streaming Inference: Scaling & Data Poisoning pada LOF(novelty=True) ===\")\nprint(\"Konfigurasi Pipeline                      | Test PR-AUC | Anom Recall | Normal FPR | Catatan\")\nprint(\"-\" * 98)\nfor label, model, note in [\n    (\"A) Unscaled LOF(novelty=True) Clean\", lof_unscaled, \"Fitur getaran lenyap!\"),\n    (\"B) RobustScaler + LOF Poisoned Train\", pipe_poisoned, \"Klaster anomali menipu LRD!\"),\n    (\"C) RobustScaler + LOF Clean Baseline\", pipe_clean, \"Deteksi halus & bersih\"),\n]:\n    scores = -model.decision_function(X_test)\n    preds = (model.predict(X_test) == -1).astype(int)\n    pr = float(average_precision_score(y_test, scores))\n    rec = 100.0 * float(np.mean(preds[y_test == 1] == 1))\n    fpr = 100.0 * float(np.mean(preds[y_test == 0] == 1))\n    print(f\"{label:41s} | {pr:11.4f} | {rec:10.1f}% | {fpr:9.1f}% | {note}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Kontrak API LocalOutlierFactor: novelty=False (Transduktif) vs novelty=True (Induktif) ===\nPanggil .predict() saat novelty=False -> AttributeError tertangkap: This 'LocalOutlierFactor' has no attribute 'predict'\n\n=== 2. Audit Online Streaming Inference: Scaling & Data Poisoning pada LOF(novelty=True) ===\nKonfigurasi Pipeline                      | Test PR-AUC | Anom Recall | Normal FPR | Catatan\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA) Unscaled LOF(novelty=True) Clean       |      0.1546 |        0.0% |       2.5% | Fitur getaran lenyap!\nB) RobustScaler + LOF Poisoned Train      |      0.0935 |        0.0% |       2.5% | Klaster anomali menipu LRD!\nC) RobustScaler + LOF Clean Baseline      |      1.0000 |      100.0% |       3.3% | Deteksi halus & bersih",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Kontrak API LocalOutlierFactor: novelty=False (Transduktif) vs novelty=True (Induktif) ===\nPanggil .predict() saat novelty=False -> AttributeError tertangkap: This 'LocalOutlierFactor' has no attribute 'predict'\n\n=== 2. Audit Online Streaming Inference: Scaling & Data Poisoning pada LOF(novelty=True) ===\nKonfigurasi Pipeline                      | Test PR-AUC | Anom Recall | Normal FPR | Catatan\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA) Unscaled LOF(novelty=True) Clean       |      0.1546 |        0.0% |       2.5% | Fitur getaran lenyap!\nB) RobustScaler + LOF Poisoned Train      |      0.0935 |        0.0% |       2.5% | Klaster anomali menipu LRD!\nC) RobustScaler + LOF Clean Baseline      |      1.0000 |      100.0% |       3.3% | Deteksi halus & bersih",
