          "title": "Production Audit: Bencana contamination='auto' Saat Payday Drift vs Dynamic Top-K Alert Budget",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "24_2_contamination_drift_alert_budget_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import IsolationForest\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2423)\n\n# Simulasi Sistem Fraud Pembayaran:\n# Train (Minggu Normal): 1.200 transaksi (99.0% sah + 1.0% fraud)\n# Prod Minggu-1 (Normal): 1.000 transaksi (99.0% sah + 1.0% fraud)\n# Prod Minggu-2 (Payday Covariate Drift): nominal & frekuensi transaksi sah naik +0.85 sigma!\ndef make_tx(n_legit: int, n_fraud: int, shift: float, rng_g: np.random.Generator) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    legit = rng_g.normal(loc=shift, scale=1.0, size=(n_legit, 6))\n    fraud = rng_g.normal(loc=shift + 3.4, scale=0.8, size=(n_fraud, 6))\n    X_out = np.vstack([legit, fraud])\n    y_out = np.array([0] * n_legit + [1] * n_fraud)\n    return X_out, y_out\n\nX_tr, y_tr = make_tx(1188, 12, shift=0.0, rng_g=rng)\nX_w1, y_w1 = make_tx(990, 10, shift=0.0, rng_g=rng)\nX_w2_drift, y_w2 = make_tx(990, 10, shift=0.85, rng_g=rng)\n\n# 1) ANTI-PATTERN A: contamination=\"auto\" (offset statis = -0.5) tanpa kalibrasi\niso_auto = IsolationForest(n_estimators=100, max_samples=256, contamination=\"auto\", random_state=42).fit(X_tr)\n\n# 2) ANTI-PATTERN B: menebak contamination=0.08 padahal laju fraud nyata hanya 1.0%\niso_guess = IsolationForest(n_estimators=100, max_samples=256, contamination=0.08, random_state=42).fit(X_tr)\n\n# 3) PRODUCTION-SAFE: Pisahkan skor kontinu & ambang berbasis Alert Budget (mis. kapasitas tim = 20 tiket / 1000 tx)\n#    Pada Minggu-2 ber-drift, skor dinormalisasi lewat dynamic batch quantile (Top-20 alert budget)\ns_w1 = -iso_auto.score_samples(X_w1)\ns_w2 = -iso_auto.score_samples(X_w2_drift)\n\n# Ambang statis terkalibrasi dari persentil-98 skor training\ntau_static_budget = float(np.quantile(-iso_auto.score_samples(X_tr), 0.98))\n\ndef eval_alerts(name: str, y_ref: np.ndarray, flagged: np.ndarray, scores: np.ndarray) -> None:\n    n_alerts = int(np.sum(flagged))\n    tp = int(np.sum((flagged == 1) & (y_ref == 1)))\n    prec = 100.0 * tp / max(n_alerts, 1)\n    rec = 100.0 * tp / max(int(np.sum(y_ref == 1)), 1)\n    pr = float(average_precision_score(y_ref, scores))\n    print(f\"{name:44s} | Alerts={n_alerts:3d} | TP={tp:2d}/10 | Prec={prec:5.1f}% | Rec={rec:5.1f}% | PR-AUC={pr:.4f}\")\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Evaluasi Minggu-1 (Normal, Laju Fraud 1.0%, Kapasitas Analis = 20 Tiket) ===\")\neval_alerts(\"A) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto'\", y_w1, (iso_auto.predict(X_w1) == -1).astype(int), s_w1)\neval_alerts(\"B) Anti-Pattern: tebakan contamination=0.08\", y_w1, (iso_guess.predict(X_w1) == -1).astype(int), s_w1)\neval_alerts(\"C) Production: Static Budget q98 (20 tiket)\", y_w1, (s_w1 >= tau_static_budget).astype(int), s_w1)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Evaluasi Minggu-2 (Payday Covariate Drift +0.85 sigma: Banjir False Alert vs Dynamic Budget) ===\")\neval_alerts(\"A) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto' Drift\", y_w2, (iso_auto.predict(X_w2_drift) == -1).astype(int), s_w2)\neval_alerts(\"C) Static Budget q98 Tanpa Drift Guard\", y_w2, (s_w2 >= tau_static_budget).astype(int), s_w2)\ntau_dynamic_20 = float(np.partition(s_w2, -20)[-20])\neval_alerts(\"D) Production: Dynamic Top-20 Alert Budget\", y_w2, (s_w2 >= tau_dynamic_20).astype(int), s_w2)",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Evaluasi Minggu-1 (Normal, Laju Fraud 1.0%, Kapasitas Analis = 20 Tiket) ===\nA) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto'        | Alerts= 94 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 10.6% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nB) Anti-Pattern: tebakan contamination=0.08  | Alerts= 94 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 10.6% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nC) Production: Static Budget q98 (20 tiket)  | Alerts= 17 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 58.8% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\n\n=== 2. Evaluasi Minggu-2 (Payday Covariate Drift +0.85 sigma: Banjir False Alert vs Dynamic Budget) ===\nA) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto' Drift  | Alerts=298 | TP=10/10 | Prec=  3.4% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nC) Static Budget q98 Tanpa Drift Guard       | Alerts= 75 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 13.3% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nD) Production: Dynamic Top-20 Alert Budget   | Alerts= 20 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 50.0% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Evaluasi Minggu-1 (Normal, Laju Fraud 1.0%, Kapasitas Analis = 20 Tiket) ===\nA) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto'        | Alerts= 94 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 10.6% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nB) Anti-Pattern: tebakan contamination=0.08  | Alerts= 94 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 10.6% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nC) Production: Static Budget q98 (20 tiket)  | Alerts= 17 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 58.8% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\n\n=== 2. Evaluasi Minggu-2 (Payday Covariate Drift +0.85 sigma: Banjir False Alert vs Dynamic Budget) ===\nA) Anti-Pattern: contamination='auto' Drift  | Alerts=298 | TP=10/10 | Prec=  3.4% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nC) Static Budget q98 Tanpa Drift Guard       | Alerts= 75 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 13.3% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000\nD) Production: Dynamic Top-20 Alert Budget   | Alerts= 20 | TP=10/10 | Prec= 50.0% | Rec=100.0% | PR-AUC=1.0000",
