          "id": "ml-24-3-ex-2",
          "level": 2,
          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `ecod_score_and_top_feature(X_train, x_query)` menggunakan NumPy dan `scipy.stats.skew(X_train, axis=0, bias=False)` yang: (1) mengurutkan setiap kolom `X_train` lalu menghitung probabilitas ekor kiri `(searchsorted(col, q, side='right') + 0.5) / (n + 1)` dan ekor kanan `(n - searchsorted(col, q, side='left') + 0.5) / (n + 1)`; (2) membentuk vektor negatif-log ekor kiri, ekor kanan, dan *skewness-corrected* (`nl_a` memilih kiri jika `skew < 0` dan kanan jika `skew >= 0`); serta (3) memilih cabang dengan jumlah skor terbesar lalu mengembalikan tuple `(round(best_score, 4), top_feature_idx, round(top_feature_share, 4))`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import skew\n\ndef ecod_score_and_top_feature(X_train, x_query) -> tuple[float, int, float]:\n    X_tr = np.asarray(X_train, dtype=float)\n    x_q = np.asarray(x_query, dtype=float)\n    n, d = X_tr.shape\n    # TODO: hitung skew -> searchsorted ekor kiri & kanan -> pilih max(O_left, O_right, O_auto) -> root-cause index & share\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2439)\nX_tr_s = np.column_stack([\n    rng.lognormal(1.0, 0.3, size=400),\n    100.0 - rng.exponential(0.5, size=400),\n    rng.normal(50.0, 5.0, size=400),\n])\nprint(ecod_score_and_top_feature(X_tr_s, [2.7, 94.0, 50.5]))",
