          "id": "code-ml-24-4-ch24_4_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Runtuhnya Pemangkasan KDTree/BallTree di 128D & Bencana Tanpa Normalizer('l2')",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "24_4_sklearn_kdtree_collapse_l2_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import BallTree, KDTree, NearestNeighbors\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import Normalizer\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2442)\n\n# 1) Audit Keruntuhan Pemangkasan KD-Tree Saat Dimensi Naik (d = 2 -> 128)\n#    Ukur fraksi rata-rata leaf/jarak yang TETAP harus dievaluasi pada kueri k=10 (N=1200)\nN_pts, n_q, leaf_sz = 1200, 40, 20\nprint(\"=== 1. Runtuhnya Efisiensi Pemangkasan KDTree & BallTree pada Dimensi Tinggi (N=1200, k=10) ===\")\nprint(\"Dimensi d | KDTree Avg Dist Evals | % Data Dipindai (KD) | BallTree Avg Evals | % Data Dipindai (Ball)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 102)\nfor d in [2, 8, 20, 64, 128]:\n    X_d = rng.standard_normal((N_pts, d))\n    Q_d = rng.standard_normal((n_q, d))\n    kdt = KDTree(X_d, leaf_size=leaf_sz)\n    bt = BallTree(X_d, leaf_size=leaf_sz)\n    # Hitung rasio sel yang harus dibuka lewat dua kueri (memakai atribut statistik internal reset_n_calls)\n    kdt.reset_n_calls()\n    kdt.query(Q_d, k=10)\n    kd_dists = int(kdt.get_n_calls())\n    bt.reset_n_calls()\n    bt.query(Q_d, k=10)\n    bt_dists = int(bt.get_n_calls())\n    kd_avg = kd_dists / n_q\n    bt_avg = bt_dists / n_q\n    print(f\"{d:9d} | {kd_avg:21.1f} | {100.0 * kd_avg / N_pts:19.1f}% | {bt_avg:18.1f} | {100.0 * bt_avg / N_pts:21.1f}%\")\n\n# 2) Audit Bug Produksi: NearestNeighbors Euclidean Tanpa Normalisasi L2 pada Embedding 128D\n#    Embedding semantik nyata memiliki variasi panjang (norma 1.0..8.0) akibat panjang teks/popularitas!\nD_emb = 128\ncenters = rng.standard_normal((6, D_emb))\ncenters /= np.linalg.norm(centers, axis=1, keepdims=True)\nembs = []\nfor c in range(6):\n    dirs = centers[c] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.16, size=(100, D_emb))\n    dirs /= np.linalg.norm(dirs, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    mags = rng.uniform(1.0, 8.0, size=(100, 1))\n    embs.append(dirs * mags)\nX_128 = np.vstack(embs)\nQ_128 = (centers[0] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.16, size=(30, D_emb)))\nQ_128 = (Q_128 / np.linalg.norm(Q_128, axis=1, keepdims=True)) * rng.uniform(1.0, 2.0, size=(30, 1))\n\n# Ground-truth semantik: Cosine similarity sejati (identik dengan Euclidean setelah Normalizer('l2')!)\nnormer = Normalizer(norm=\"l2\")\nX_u = normer.fit_transform(X_128)\nQ_u = normer.transform(Q_128)\n\nnn_cos_gt = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=10, algorithm=\"brute\", metric=\"cosine\").fit(X_128)\ngt_cos_idx = nn_cos_gt.kneighbors(Q_128, return_distance=False)\n\nnn_bad_euc = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=10, algorithm=\"kd_tree\", metric=\"euclidean\").fit(X_128)\nbad_idx = nn_bad_euc.kneighbors(Q_128, return_distance=False)\n\nnn_safe_l2 = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=10, algorithm=\"brute\", metric=\"euclidean\").fit(X_u)\nsafe_idx = nn_safe_l2.kneighbors(Q_u, return_distance=False)\n\nrec_bad = 100.0 * np.mean([len(set(bad_idx[i]).intersection(gt_cos_idx[i])) / 10.0 for i in range(len(Q_128))])\nrec_safe = 100.0 * np.mean([len(set(safe_idx[i]).intersection(gt_cos_idx[i])) / 10.0 for i in range(len(Q_128))])\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Relevansi Semantik Embedding 128D (Norma 1.0..8.0): Tanpa vs Dengan Normalizer('l2') ===\")\nprint(f\"ANTI-PATTERN: KDTree Euclidean Mentah (Tanpa L2-Norm) | Semantic Recall@10 = {rec_bad:5.1f}%  <-- RUSAK OLEH NORMA!\")\nprint(f\"PRODUCTION  : Normalizer('l2') + Euclidean/Dot Search | Semantic Recall@10 = {rec_safe:5.1f}%  <-- EKSAK COSINE!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Runtuhnya Efisiensi Pemangkasan KDTree & BallTree pada Dimensi Tinggi (N=1200, k=10) ===\nDimensi d | KDTree Avg Dist Evals | % Data Dipindai (KD) | BallTree Avg Evals | % Data Dipindai (Ball)\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n        2 |                  89.0 |                 7.4% |              496.1 |                  41.3%\n        8 |                 918.1 |                76.5% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n       20 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n       64 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n      128 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n\n=== 2. Audit Relevansi Semantik Embedding 128D (Norma 1.0..8.0): Tanpa vs Dengan Normalizer('l2') ===\nANTI-PATTERN: KDTree Euclidean Mentah (Tanpa L2-Norm) | Semantic Recall@10 =   3.7%  <-- RUSAK OLEH NORMA!\nPRODUCTION  : Normalizer('l2') + Euclidean/Dot Search | Semantic Recall@10 = 100.0%  <-- EKSAK COSINE!",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Runtuhnya Efisiensi Pemangkasan KDTree & BallTree pada Dimensi Tinggi (N=1200, k=10) ===\nDimensi d | KDTree Avg Dist Evals | % Data Dipindai (KD) | BallTree Avg Evals | % Data Dipindai (Ball)\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n        2 |                  89.0 |                 7.4% |              496.1 |                  41.3%\n        8 |                 918.1 |                76.5% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n       20 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n       64 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n      128 |                1200.0 |               100.0% |             1263.0 |                 105.2%\n\n=== 2. Audit Relevansi Semantik Embedding 128D (Norma 1.0..8.0): Tanpa vs Dengan Normalizer('l2') ===\nANTI-PATTERN: KDTree Euclidean Mentah (Tanpa L2-Norm) | Semantic Recall@10 =   3.7%  <-- RUSAK OLEH NORMA!\nPRODUCTION  : Normalizer('l2') + Euclidean/Dot Search | Semantic Recall@10 = 100.0%  <-- EKSAK COSINE!",
