          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2443)\n\n# 1) Capacity Planning RAM Skala Produksi Vector Database (Embedding 768D)\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Footprint RAM Vector Search 768D: Flat FP32 vs HNSW vs PQ-8bit (48 Sub-Ruang) ===\")\nprint(\"Skala Vektor N | Flat FP32 (GB) | HNSW M=32 FP32 (GB) | IVF-PQ m=48 (GB) | HNSW+PQ m=48 (GB) | Rasio PQ\")\nprint(\"-\" * 105)\nd_emb = 768\nm_pq = 48\nM_hnsw = 32\nfor N in [100_000, 1_000_000, 10_000_000, 100_000_000]:\n    gb = 1024 ** 3\n    flat_gb = (N * d_emb * 4) / gb\n    # Graf HNSW menyimpan rata-rata ~2*M link int32 (4 byte) di layer 0 + ~10% overhead lapisan atas\n    graph_gb = (N * (2 * M_hnsw * 4) * 1.1) / gb\n    pq_gb = (N * m_pq * 1) / gb\n    hnsw_flat_gb = flat_gb + graph_gb\n    hnsw_pq_gb = pq_gb + graph_gb\n    ratio = flat_gb / pq_gb\n    print(f\"{N:14,d} | {flat_gb:14.2f} | {hnsw_flat_gb:19.2f} | {pq_gb:16.2f} | {hnsw_pq_gb:17.2f} | {ratio:7.1f}x\")\n\n# 2) Bukti Empiris Mengapa Asymmetric (ADC) Lebih Akurat daripada Symmetric Distance (SDC) di PQ!\nN_s, D_s, m_s, k_s = 500, 64, 8, 32\nd_sub = D_s // m_s\nX_s = rng.standard_normal((N_s, D_s)).astype(np.float32)\nX_s /= np.linalg.norm(X_s, axis=1, keepdims=True)\nQ_s = rng.standard_normal((40, D_s)).astype(np.float32)\nQ_s /= np.linalg.norm(Q_s, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n\ncb = np.empty((m_s, k_s, d_sub), dtype=np.float32)\nx_codes = np.empty((N_s, m_s), dtype=np.uint8)\nq_codes = np.empty((40, m_s), dtype=np.uint8)\nX_recon = np.empty_like(X_s)\nQ_recon = np.empty_like(Q_s)\n\nfor j in range(m_s):\n    sl = slice(j * d_sub, (j + 1) * d_sub)\n    sub = X_s[:, sl]\n    rg = np.random.default_rng(42 + j)\n    C = sub[rg.choice(N_s, size=k_s, replace=False)].copy()\n    lbl = np.zeros(N_s, dtype=int)\n    for _ in range(10):\n        lbl = np.argmin(np.sum((sub[:, None, :] - C[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2), axis=1)\n        for ci in range(k_s):\n            mk = lbl == ci\n            if np.any(mk):\n                C[ci] = np.mean(sub[mk], axis=0)\n    cb[j] = C\n    x_codes[:, j] = lbl.astype(np.uint8)\n    X_recon[:, sl] = cb[j][x_codes[:, j]]\n    qd = np.sum((Q_s[:, None, sl] - cb[j][None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)\n    q_codes[:, j] = np.argmin(qd, axis=1).astype(np.uint8)\n    Q_recon[:, sl] = cb[j][q_codes[:, j]]\n\ntrue_d2 = np.sum((Q_s[:, None, :] - X_s[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)\nadc_d2 = np.sum((Q_s[:, None, :] - X_recon[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)      # Q asli vs X terkuantisasi\nsdc_d2 = np.sum((Q_recon[:, None, :] - X_recon[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)  # Keduanya terkuantisasi!\n\nrmse_adc = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((adc_d2 - true_d2) ** 2)))\nrmse_sdc = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((sdc_d2 - true_d2) ** 2)))\ngt_10 = np.argsort(true_d2, axis=1)[:, :10]\nadc_10 = np.argsort(adc_d2, axis=1)[:, :10]\nsdc_10 = np.argsort(sdc_d2, axis=1)[:, :10]\nrec_adc = 100.0 * float(np.mean([len(set(adc_10[i]).intersection(gt_10[i])) / 10.0 for i in range(40)]))\nrec_sdc = 100.0 * float(np.mean([len(set(sdc_10[i]).intersection(gt_10[i])) / 10.0 for i in range(40)]))\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Presisi PQ: Asymmetric Distance (ADC) vs Symmetric Distance (SDC) ===\")\nprint(f\"ADC (Q Asli vs X Terkuantisasi)  | Distance RMSE = {rmse_adc:.4f} | Recall@10 = {rec_adc:5.1f}%\")\nprint(f\"SDC (Q & X Sama-Sama Dikuantisi) | Distance RMSE = {rmse_sdc:.4f} | Recall@10 = {rec_sdc:5.1f}%  (Galat ~{rmse_sdc/rmse_adc:.2f}x lebih buruk!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Footprint RAM Vector Search 768D: Flat FP32 vs HNSW vs PQ-8bit (48 Sub-Ruang) ===\nSkala Vektor N | Flat FP32 (GB) | HNSW M=32 FP32 (GB) | IVF-PQ m=48 (GB) | HNSW+PQ m=48 (GB) | Rasio PQ\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n       100,000 |           0.29 |                0.31 |             0.00 |              0.03 |    64.0x\n     1,000,000 |           2.86 |                3.12 |             0.04 |              0.31 |    64.0x\n    10,000,000 |          28.61 |               31.23 |             0.45 |              3.07 |    64.0x\n   100,000,000 |         286.10 |              312.33 |             4.47 |             30.70 |    64.0x\n\n=== 2. Audit Presisi PQ: Asymmetric Distance (ADC) vs Symmetric Distance (SDC) ===\nADC (Q Asli vs X Terkuantisasi)  | Distance RMSE = 0.4651 | Recall@10 =  33.2%\nSDC (Q & X Sama-Sama Dikuantisi) | Distance RMSE = 0.9062 | Recall@10 =  19.2%  (Galat ~1.95x lebih buruk!)",
